UID: APLLSR-008-T01
TITLE: Invalid Encoding Error Generation
TEST_TYPE: Robustness
TEST_LEVEL: Unit
PRECONDITIONS: Audio codec parameters containing invalid encoding information are available
INPUTS: Audio codec parameters containing invalid encoding information
PROCEDURE: >>>
1. Supply the audio codec parameters to the encoding validation procedure.
