  VALUE: APLLSR-008
  ROLE: Verifies

[TEST]
UID: APLLSR-009-T01
TITLE: No Audio Track Detection
TEST_TYPE: Robustness
TEST_LEVEL: Integration
PRECONDITIONS: A valid media file containing no audio tracks is available
INPUTS: An audio stream containing no audio tracks
PROCEDURE: >>>
1. Supply the input stream to the audio identification subsystem.
2. Execute the identification procedure.
3. Examine the returned error.
<<<
EXPECTED_RESULT: >>>
The software generates a no-audio-track error.
<<<
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall verify that the software detects when an input audio stream
contains no audio tracks.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: APLLSR-009
  ROLE: Verifies

[TEST]
UID: APLLSR-010-T01
TITLE: FLAC Encoding Identification
TEST_TYPE: Functional
TEST_LEVEL: Integration
PRECONDITIONS: A valid FLAC audio file is available
INPUTS: A valid FLAC audio stream
PROCEDURE: >>>
1. Supply the FLAC audio stream to the audio identification subsystem.
2. Execute the identification procedure.
3. Examine the identified encoding.
<<<
EXPECTED_RESULT: >>>
The software identifies the audio encoding as FLAC.
<<<
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall verify that the software correctly identifies FLAC as the
encoding of an input audio stream.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: APLLSR-010
  ROLE: Verifies

