TEST_LEVEL: Subsystem
PRECONDITIONS: A valid FLAC audio file is available
INPUTS: A valid FLAC audio stream with a .flac filename extension
PROCEDURE: >>>
1. Supply the FLAC audio stream to the audio identification subsystem.
2. Execute the identification procedure.
3. Examine the identified format and encoding.
<<<
EXPECTED_RESULT: >>>
The software identifies the stream's format and encoding as FLAC.
<<<
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall verify that the software correctly identifies a FLAC audio
stream with a .flac filename extension.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: APLLSR-011
  ROLE: Verifies

[TEST]
UID: APLLSR-011-T02
TITLE: FLAC Identification with Different Filename Extension
TEST_TYPE: Compatibility
TEST_LEVEL: Subsystem
PRECONDITIONS: A valid FLAC audio file is available
INPUTS: A valid FLAC audio stream with an .mp3 filename extension
PROCEDURE: >>>
1. Supply the FLAC audio stream to the audio identification subsystem.
2. Execute the identification procedure.
3. Examine the identified format and encoding.
<<<
EXPECTED_RESULT: >>>
The software identifies the stream's format and encoding as FLAC.
<<<
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall verify that the software correctly identifies a FLAC audio
stream independently of an incorrect filename extension.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: APLLSR-011
  ROLE: Verifies

[TEST]
UID: APLLSR-011-T03
TITLE: FLAC Identification without Filename Extension
TEST_TYPE: Compatibility
TEST_LEVEL: Subsystem
PRECONDITIONS: A valid FLAC audio file is available
INPUTS: A valid FLAC audio stream without a filename extension
PROCEDURE: >>>
1. Supply the FLAC audio stream to the audio identification subsystem.
2. Execute the identification procedure.
3. Examine the identified format and encoding.
<<<
EXPECTED_RESULT: >>>
The software identifies the stream's format and encoding as FLAC.
<<<
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall verify that the software correctly identifies a FLAC audio
stream without relying on a filename extension.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: APLLSR-011
  ROLE: Verifies

